      en: ["Largest man-made island in the Maldives", "Land reclamation began on October 16, 1997", "Connected to Malé via Sinamalé Bridge since 2018", "Planned target population of approx. 240,000", "Elevation of 2 meters above sea level for resilience", "Home to the extensive Hulhumalé Central Park"],
